<title>CHINA: Shanghai rice market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Shanghai rice market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai's rice futures market was closed on Monday because of National Day holidays, an exchange official said. Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the last trading day, the key October contract ended at 2,200 yuan per tonne, down 40 yuan.</p>
